    },
    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Grains wait on USDA",
        "body": "- Dec corn is at **$4.41½** and Jan soybeans are at $11.94¼, both up half a percent overnight.\n- Feedstuffs says grain prices faltered Monday ahead of the report, with the question being more soy and less corn.",
