        "conviction_level": "low",
        "overnight_surprise": false
      },
      {
        "title": "Hogs bounce, cattle gain",
        "body": "- Dec hogs settled Monday at **$55.875**, up 4.4%, and USDA put national cash hogs at $53.91 carcass base.\n- Dec live cattle settled at $216.20, up 1.0%, and Nov feeders added 1.9% to $328.35.",
        "so_what": "Hogs bounced from a low base, near the bottom of their 52-week.",
        "conviction_level": "medium",
        "overnight_surprise": false
      },
      {
        "title": "Crude slips on Iran signal",
        "body": "- WTI is at **$85.68** overnight, down 1.3% from Monday's $86.85 settle.\n- Oilprice reports Brent fell below $90 for the first time since August after Trump signaled no strikes on Iran.",
